  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PRONORD - R&#xe9;silience -Forest4Futur</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The Specific Objective (outcome) of the Action reads as follows: The resilience of production systems and ecosystems managed by farmers and livestock keepers, especially the most vulnerable (young people and women), is increased.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The central proposition of this Action is to enable local and public stakeholders to restore and maintain forest and tree cover in productive landscapes with the aim of increasing the resilience of ecosystems and their services for water regulation and sustainable provision of food and materials as a basis for local livelihoods &lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
